<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Mock Interview Scheduled | RecruitWay</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap');

        body {
            font-family: 'Poppins', Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333333;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f5f7fa;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: white;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6a11cb 0%, #2575fc 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 28px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .greeting {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .details-card {
            background-color: #f0f8ff;
            padding: 25px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-left: 4px solid #2575fc;
        }

        .details-card h3 {
            margin-top: 0;
            color: #2c3e50;
        }

        .details-card p {
            margin: 10px 0;
        }

        .interview-link {
            word-break: break-all;
            color: #2575fc;
            font-weight: 500;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .interview-link:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .preparation-tips {
            background-color: #fffaf0;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            border-left: 4px solid #ffb347;
        }

        .preparation-tips ul {
            margin: 10px 0;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }

        .preparation-tips li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #777;
            background: #f5f7fa;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
        }

        .social-links {
            margin: 15px 0;
        }

        .social-links a {
            margin: 0 10px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #2575fc;
        }

        .company-info {
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .signature {
            margin-top: 25px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
            padding-top: 15px;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #2575fc;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }

        .profile-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #e8f4ff;
            color: #2575fc;
            padding: 5px 10px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin: 5px 0;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Your Mock Interview Has Been Scheduled</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <p class="greeting">Dear <strong>
                    <%= candidateName %>
                </strong>,</p>
            <p>We're pleased to confirm your upcoming mock interview with RecruitWay. This is a great opportunity to
                practice and refine your interview skills.</p>

            <div class="details-card">
                <h3>Mock Interview Details</h3>
                <p><strong>Candidate:</strong>
                    <%= candidateName %>
                </p>
                <p><strong>Technical Profile:</strong> <span class="profile-badge">
                        <%= profile %>
                    </span></p>
                <p><strong>Experience Level:</strong> <span class="profile-badge">
                        <%= experienceLevel %>
                    </span></p>
                <p><strong>Interviewer:</strong>
                    <%= interviewerName %>
                </p>
                <p><strong>Date:</strong>
                    <%= date %>
                </p>
                <p><strong>Time:</strong>
                    <%= time %> - <%= endTime %>
                </p>
                <p><strong>Interview Link:</strong><br>
                    <a href="<%= interviewUrl %>" class="interview-link">"<%= interviewUrl %>"</a>
                </p>
                <p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong><br>
                    <%= candidateName %>
                </p>
            </div>

            <center>
                <a href="<%= interviewUrl %>" class="button">Join Mock Interview</a>
            </center>

            <div class="preparation-tips">
                <p><strong>Preparation Tips for Your Mock Interview:</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Review common interview questions for {{profile}} {{experienceLevel}} positions</li>
                    <li>Prepare examples of your work or projects that demonstrate your skills</li>
                    <li>Test your technology (camera, microphone, and internet connection) beforehand</li>
                    <li>Have your resume and any relevant materials ready for reference</li>
                    <li>Prepare questions to ask about the role and interview process</li>
                    <li>Plan to join 5-10 minutes early to ensure everything is working properly</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <p>This mock interview is designed to help you practice and receive constructive feedback. We encourage you
                to treat it as a real interview to get the most benefit from the experience.</p>

            <p>If you need to reschedule or have any questions, please contact us at <a
                    href="mailto:support@recruitway.com">support@recruitway.com</a>.</p>

            <div class="signature">
                <p>Best regards,<br>
                    <strong>RecruitWay Mock Interview Team</strong>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <div class="social-links">
                <a href="https://linkedin.com/company/recruitway">LinkedIn</a> |
                <a href="https://twitter.com/recruitway">Twitter</a> |
                <a href="https://facebook.com/recruitway">Facebook</a>
            </div>
            <div class="company-info">
                <p>
                    RecruitWay Inc.<br>
                    123 Business Avenue, Suite 100<br>
                    San Francisco, CA 94107
                </p>
            </div>
            <p>This is an automated message. Please do not reply directly to this email.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>